{
  "_doc": "Behaviour scenarios for the image zoom of the demo site (examples/demo, <ImageZoom> = react-medium-image-zoom 5.4.9 in fumadocs-ui). Format: see the header of verify/behaviour.mjs. Paths are demo site paths. Observed are only state attributes (open, data-rmiz-content, data-rmiz-modal-overlay, aria-*), computed styles, animations, focus and the scroll lock on body, no class lists. id and aria-labelledby of the dialog carry a random part (rmiz-modal-<hash>) and are therefore not observed. Rules from controlled.js of react-medium-image-zoom: open by a click on the image or on [data-rmiz-btn-zoom]. Close by Esc (keydown in the capture phase on document), by a click on [data-rmiz-modal-content] or [data-rmiz-modal-img], by [data-rmiz-btn-unzoom], by the mouse wheel (wheel on window, registered only after the opening transition, ignored with ctrlKey and with visualViewport.scale > 1) and by a vertical swipe above swipeToUnzoomThreshold. Setting the scroll position without a wheel event doesn't close. The wheel is dispatched as a WheelEvent on window through evaluate, because the scroll action of behaviour.mjs only sets scrollTo; that is identical on both sides. Swiping has no scenario: behaviour.mjs has no touch action, and synthetic TouchEvents need a context with hasTouch.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "image-zoom-open-click-image",
      "page": "/guide/writing-pages",
      "actions": [
        {
          "waitFor": "#images"
        },
        {
          "evaluate": "document.querySelector('[data-rmiz-content] img').scrollIntoView({ block: 'center' })"
        },
        {
          "wait": 300
        },
        {
          "evaluate": "(async () => { const img = document.querySelector('[data-rmiz-content] img'); if (!img.complete) await new Promise((r) => img.addEventListener('load', r, { once: true })); await img.decode().catch(() => {}); })()"
        },
        {
          "waitFor": "[data-rmiz-btn-zoom]"
        },
        {
          "click": "[data-rmiz-content] img",
          "sample": true
        }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": [
          "[data-rmiz-content]",
          "[data-rmiz-btn-zoom]",
          "dialog[data-rmiz-modal]",
          "[data-rmiz-modal-overlay]",
          "[data-rmiz-modal-img]",
          "[data-rmiz-btn-unzoom]"
        ],
        "attributes": [
          "open",
          "data-rmiz-content",
          "data-rmiz-modal-overlay",
          "aria-label",
          "aria-modal",
          "role",
          "hidden",
          "style"
        ],
        "styleProps": [
          "opacity",
          "visibility",
          "transform",
          "cursor"
        ],
        "animations": true,
        "focus": true,
        "scrollLocked": true
      },
      "sample": [
        "frame0",
        "frame1",
        "animationend",
        "settled"
      ]
    },
